                            <comment id="16153471" author="luis.vicente" created="Tue, 5 Sep 2017 10:58:40 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In order to fix this issue we just need to add JdbcUtils.closeConnection(con); to the finally block of that method. I will submit a PR.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16153479" author="githubbot" created="Tue, 5 Sep 2017 11:05:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user lvicentesanchez opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2567&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2567&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2900&quot; title=&quot;GetUserList.getUserList leaks JdbcRealm connections&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-2900&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-2900&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Close connection on getUserList&lt;/p&gt;

