	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    In order to reproduce the bug follow this steps:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    1. Configure zeppelin to use a JdbcRealm for authentication with a low number of connections in the connection pool.&lt;br/&gt;
    2. Login into zeppelin and open a notebook.&lt;br/&gt;
    3. Open the permissions form of the notebook.&lt;br/&gt;
    4. Try to add several users to the owners list (more than the number of connections of the connection pool.&lt;/p&gt;

